{title: Tinka Tinka Zara Zara}
{artist: Alisha Chinai Vishal Shekhar}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m]tinka tinka jara jara,
[Fm]Hai roshnee [A#m]se jaise bhara
[A#m]tinka tinka jara jara,
[Fm]Hai roshnee [A#m]se jaise bhara
[F#]Har dil [G#]mai arman [A#m]hote toh hai
[F#]Har dil [G#]mai arman [A#m]hote toh hai
[G#]Bas [F#]koyee [A#m]samjhe jara
[Fm]Dil pe [G#]ek naya [Fm]sa nasha [A#m]chha gaya
[Fm]Kho raha [G#]tha jo [Fm]khwab woh [A#m]laut aa gaya
[A#m]Yeh jo ehsas [Fm]hai jo karar hai,
[A#m]Kya isee kaa [Fm]hee nam pyar hai
[G#]Puchhe [F#]dil [A#m]thumke jara
